(* `needless_rec` (ADR 0047): a `let rec` type that is in no cycle.
// RUN: piac --verify %s 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: needless_rec.pia:[[@LINE+3]]:1: warning: 'pair' is declared 'let rec' but does not refer to itself; drop 'rec' [needless_rec]
